<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Primedia half year earnings jump 54 pct.</title>
<headline>Primedia half year earnings jump 54 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr per combined unit (cts) 37    vs 24</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			 -     vs -</p>
<p>    Attributable income	 15.9    vs 5.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    38.7    vs 19.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		     147.7    vs 88.9</p>
<p>Full name : Primedia ltd (beverages, hotels and leisure)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said assuming no adverse change in trading conditions, earnings per combined unit for the second half should at least be equal to those achieved in the present reporting period.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
